1
00:00:00,673 --> 00:00:02,153
(Howard:)And I'm gonna miss you, too.

2
00:00:02,308 --> 00:00:03,308
(Raj:)I just want you to know,

3
00:00:03,476 --> 00:00:05,316
(Raj:)I'm happy to look in on Bernadette
while you're gone.

4
00:00:05,511 --> 00:00:06,511
(Howard:)Thank you.

5
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:07,889
(Raj:)And if anything were to happen
to you,

6
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:10,027
(Raj:)we will name our
firstborn son Howard.

7
00:00:12,218 --> 00:00:13,388
(Raj:)I'm just kidding.

8
00:00:13,553 --> 00:00:15,223
(Raj:)We'll name him Dalib,
after my grandfather.

9
00:00:18,624 --> 00:00:20,404
(Penny:)This one looks nice.

10
00:00:20,526 --> 00:00:23,196
(Leonard:)No. Sheldon doesn't like
reclaimed wood.

11
00:00:24,297 --> 00:00:25,297
(Penny:)Why not?

12
00:00:25,364 --> 00:00:28,004
(Leonard:)He's afraid the original owners
will come back.

13
00:00:29,669 --> 00:00:31,239
(Penny:)Well, Sheldon's not here.

14
00:00:31,404 --> 00:00:32,644
(Leonard:)Well, he is here.

15
00:00:33,873 --> 00:00:36,683
(Leonard:)Unless you want to dig him out
with a bone saw and a melon baller,

16
00:00:36,843 --> 00:00:38,753
(Leonard:)there's nothing I can do about it.

17
00:00:38,911 --> 00:00:40,751
(Penny:)All right, sweetie,
you're paying for this table,

18
00:00:40,913 --> 00:00:41,913
(Penny:)and it's your apartment, too.

19
00:00:42,081 --> 00:00:43,751
(Leonard:)-I know, but--
-No buts.

20
00:00:43,916 --> 00:00:46,526
(Penny:)You got to stop
letting him boss you around.

21
00:00:46,586 --> 00:00:49,936
(Leonard:)You're right. I mean,
he decides what TV shows we watch,

22
00:00:50,089 --> 00:00:52,429
(Leonard:)what food we eat,
who my favourite hobbit is.

23
00:00:52,592 --> 00:00:54,662
(Leonard:)I wanted Frodo,
but we can't both have Frodo,

24
00:00:54,827 --> 00:00:56,867
(Leonard:)so guess who's stuck
with Samwise Gamgee.

25
00:00:58,731 --> 00:01:00,401
(Penny:)See? Right there.
You're a grown man,

